1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Plan before you launch. A mission trainer for ages 7–12.
Learn how power, storage and oxygen connect.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Predict, then explain why.
Your equipment and settings decide what happens.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Stored: 2.4 kWh. Needed: 3.6 kWh.
The starter plan stops at hour 10.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,500
Half air in shadow reaches all 12 hours.
Save 1.5 kWh; spend 0.20 kg of tank oxygen.

5
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,000
Protect the crew and complete a science task
during a 98-hour archived storm.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000
NASA references drive the calculation.
Build. Predict. Observe. Revise. Offline on iPhone and iPad.
